Z||000007||Indiana_resto_guy||08-09-2001||02:27 AM||||The reason he went to Ireland is because after GM said no there wasn't a bank in the US that would loan him money.<P>The plant closed due to lack of sales and he couldn't pay his bills. I guess dope was in a slump as well! (LOL)<P>The car was very heavy due to the stainless steel design and wasn't very quick, even with a good power plant.||||reg||1
